        <UserObject label="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The diagram&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;-apple-system, system-ui, Segoe UI, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;illustrates the Stage 3 Suite-state for Identity Access Management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;It split into two zones:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Customer-managed IAM (left): the customer&#39;s third-party identity provider / identity management, an IAM Administrator, and a Worker/Business User, connected into SAP to the Cloud Identity Services only.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#1f2328&quot; face=&quot;-apple-system, system-ui, Segoe UI, Noto Sans, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;SAP-managed IAM (center): SAP Cloud Identity Services as the central hub, broken into its four services — Identity Directory, Identity Provisioning, Authorization Management, Identity Authentication — serving the connected SAP SaaS applications of the Suite: S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition, SuccessFactors, and Sales Cloud v2, with users reaching them via Mobile/Desktop application clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" placeholders="1" name="Variable" id="ySUiqljyssg8lWwGKVSr-14">
